{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35665","headline":"兵後寻边三首 二 · 李山甫","name":"兵後寻边三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旗头指处见黄埃，万马横驰鹘翅回。\n劒戟远腥凝血在，山河先暗阵云来。\n角声恶杀悲於哭，鼓势争强怒若雷。\n日暮却登寒垒望，饱鸱清啸伏屍堆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35665.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35665","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}